    <string name="settings_help_title">About FamWake</string>
    <string name="settings_help_intro">The FamWake family alarm calculates the perfect wake-up schedule for your entire family, so that nobody gets stuck in front of a locked bathroom door in the morning.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_how_it_works">How it works:</string>
    <string name="settings_help_bullet_1"><b>Create Profiles</b>: Set when each family member needs to get up and how long they need the bathroom.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_bullet_2"><b>Plan Extras</b>: Specify who wants to have breakfast together and when they need to leave the house.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_bullet_3"><b>Your Slot</b>: Select your profile. You will be woken up exactly when it is your turn.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_bullet_4"><b>Adjust Order</b>: Simply drag &amp; drop profiles to manually change the bathroom sequence.</string>
    
